  "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/router-for-me/CLIProxyAPI/tarball/v8.1.1",
  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/router-for-me/CLIProxyAPI/zipball/v8.1.1",
  "body": "<!-- cliproxyapi-linux-release-assets:start -->\n## Linux release assets\n\n- `CLIProxyAPI_<version>_linux_<arch>.tar.gz` is the default Linux build. It supports dynamic library plugins and is built against a GLIBC 2.17 baseline.\n- `CLIProxyAPI_<version>_linux_<arch>_no-plugin.tar.gz` is the portable Linux build for musl-based or older systems such as OpenWrt. It does not support dynamic library plugins.\n\n## FreeBSD release assets\n\n- `CLIProxyAPI_<version>_freebsd_aarch64_no-plugin.tar.gz` is the FreeBSD arm64 build. It is built without CGO and does not support dynamic library plugins.\n\n<!-- cliproxyapi-linux-release-assets:end -->\n\n## Changelog\n\n- fix(util): guard const, enum, and additionalProperties schema passes with isPropertyDefinition (cad3ae5d)\n- fix(util): normalize tuple and non-object array items for native Gemini schemas (c9e6e2e3)\n- fix(xai): evict ephemeral and 24h idle websocket ID states (679166b8)\n- fix(antigravity): honor per-auth user_agent on probes, fence model publication, and omit empty project (753bfa19)\n- fix(antigravity): preserve NONE tool calling mode for Claude models (e0cc1cf8)\n- fix(antigravity): enforce short cooldowns, 429 bookkeeping, and schema sanitization in CountTokens (94b164bf)\n- fix(registry): include copilot in static model lookup (cbfc90ad)\n- feat(management): add copilot oauth support to v8 api (feadc90b)\n- fix(translator): preserve cache_control on Responses tool outputs for Claude (8cab158f)\n- fix(pluginhost): fall through to next scheduler plugin when PickAuth declines (254d0c2c)\n- fix(antigravity): guard credits refresh and project discovery on config and disabled auth (d2086b4c)\n- fix(management): fail Antigravity OAuth session when project ID discovery fails (d214f881)\n- fix(thinking/antigravity): avoid recreating orphan includeThoughts after stripping invalid Claude budget (b2151d64)\n- fix(antigravity): default omitted minimumCreditAmountForUsage to zero when parsing credits (737ba4c6)\n- fix(claude): preserve adjacent same-response thinking blocks in openai responses translation (c71aa824)\n- fix(antigravity): set X-Goog-User-Project header on Cloud Code PA requests (acf238f6)\n- fix(antigravity): scope incoming request.sessionId per credential and subagent (14e12fb5)\n- fix(codex): preserve requested Responses include values by upstream backend (7f22743a)\n- fix(devin): preserve Gemini bare-Tink thought signatures on Responses replay (28b281d5)\n- fix(antigravity): isolate reasoning replay keys using canonical and body session identities (3988a389)\n- fix(antigravity): emit uppercase thinkingLevel enum names (127c50bc)\n- fix(auth): populate canonical session metadata on Antigravity credits execute (dd0d80c8)\n- fix(session): isolate subagent identities for header-based sessions (f9ac9ffc)\n- fix(antigravity): use signed int64 session IDs matching Hub format (55e5a7ea)\n- Revert \"fix(antigravity): set X-Goog-User-Project header on Cloud Code PA requests\" (ca43428b)\n- fix(antigravity): populate request.model and strip request.stream in CountTokens (fb989e5f)\n- fix(antigravity): detach caller cancellation when committing reasoning replay state (327b4c61)\n- fix(antigravity): handle non-stream in-band errors and evict idle transports on 403/401 (ec25cc83)\n- feat(registry): unify copilot and devin published routes (f89d408e)\n- fix(antigravity): canonicalize multimodal media field names (08098d24)\n- fix(antigravity): isolate native search from chat tools (28134004)\n- Merge pull request #7900 from router-for-me/registry (c6f1d626)\n- fix(antigravity): defer non-stream reasoning replay commit until after translation error checks (555bdb4b)\n- fix(antigravity): isolate credits state by credential (16bf182f)\n- feat(registry): add Gemini 4 Neon model definition (8a8c2343)\n- chore(deps): update Go modules and upgrade moego to v0.1.0-alpha.5 (6eb8554f)\n\n\n## What's Changed\n* feat(registry): unify copilot and devin published routes by @hkfires in https://github.com/router-for-me/CLIProxyAPI/pull/7900\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/router-for-me/CLIProxyAPI/compare/v8.1.0...v8.1.1\n",
